@startuml
title androrm-detekt-rules シーケンス図（Detektルール実行）

actor "Detekt" as Detekt
participant "AndrOrmRuleSetProvider" as Provider
participant "AndrOrmEntityRefRule" as EntityRefRule
participant "AndrOrmDuplicateTableNameRule" as DuplicateRule
participant "AndrOrmViewDefinitionRule" as ViewRule
participant "AndrOrmLogger" as Logger

Detekt -> Provider: instance(config)
Provider --> Detekt: RuleSet
Detekt -> EntityRefRule: visitKtFile(file)
activate EntityRefRule
EntityRefRule -> EntityRefRule: Select/Where等のEntity参照を解析
EntityRefRule -> Logger: 検出内容をログ出力
EntityRefRule --> Detekt: CodeSmell report
deactivate EntityRefRule

Detekt -> DuplicateRule: visitKtFile(file)
activate DuplicateRule
DuplicateRule -> DuplicateRule: @Table名を収集
DuplicateRule --> Detekt: 重複テーブル名をreport
deactivate DuplicateRule

Detekt -> ViewRule: visitKtFile(file)
activate ViewRule
ViewRule -> ViewRule: @View/@Table/参照関係を検証
ViewRule --> Detekt: VIEW定義違反をreport
deactivate ViewRule
@enduml
